"},{"id":"chengguo-q-791bacb1947a88965eb8","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-546398c9e99f491661e8","layer":"original","quote":"备到下邳，杀徐州刺史车胄，反。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-835baccb7951fafa30bf","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-546398c9e99f491661e8","layer":"original","quote":"太祖令刘备拒袁术，","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o045a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-f1a07cf0a3b22cc78947","layer":"original","quote":"先是，太祖遣刘备诣徐州，拒袁术。术死，备杀刺史车胄，引军屯沛。绍遣骑佐之。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o045","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-f1a07cf0a3b22cc78947","layer":"original","quote":"先是，太祖遣刘备诣徐州，拒袁术。术死，备杀刺史车胄，引军屯沛。绍遣骑佐之。太祖遣刘岱、王忠击之，不克。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o002","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-4a482e5161fe084653a0","layer":"original","quote":"先主之袭杀徐州刺史车胄，使羽守下邳城，行太守事〖1〗；﹝一﹞而身还小沛。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":8,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o069a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b951d04332712c30fc16","layer":"original","quote":"备之未东也，阴与董承等谋反。至下邳，遂杀徐州刺史车胄，举兵屯沛〖26〗。遣刘岱、王忠击之，不克。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":366,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-51bced16741add42ff70","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：建安四年（公元 199）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20628d34a709162c77f0","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o061","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-502d4e8c0ed143eaa30d","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，公还至昌邑〖2〗。张杨将杨丑杀杨〖3〗。眭固又杀丑，以其众属袁绍，屯射犬〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o069","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b951d04332712c30fc16","layer":"original","quote":"备之未东也，阴与董承等谋反。至下邳，遂杀徐州刺史车胄，举兵屯沛〖26〗。遣刘岱、王忠击之，不克。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":366,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o016b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-b2ba16ddd29a37182478","layer":"original","quote":"先主据下邳，灵等还。先主乃杀徐州刺史车胄，留关羽守下邳，而身还小沛。﹝四﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o016","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-b2ba16ddd29a37182478","layer":"original","quote":"事觉，承等皆伏诛；﹝三﹞先主据下邳，灵等还。先主乃杀徐州刺史车胄，留关羽守下邳，而身还小沛。﹝四﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":71,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
